WEBVTT

00:23.020 --> 00:24.870
What is that?

00:30.260 --> 00:31.260
Huh?

00:32.260 --> 00:34.170
Girls?!

02:11.450 --> 02:12.770
Yeah.

02:12.770 --> 02:16.860
With all the otaku from Ariake, 
things sure are getting lively.

02:17.050 --> 02:20.840
I'm sure they'll help the 
Revolutionary Army make an impact.

02:20.840 --> 02:24.590
Gobo-bo, gobo. Gobo gobo-go?

02:20.840 --> 02:24.590
"But will they cooperate with the army?"

02:24.590 --> 02:25.870
The majority will.

02:25.870 --> 02:28.470
We should just make them.

02:28.470 --> 02:30.880
Some of them already 
follow us around anyway.

02:30.880 --> 02:34.250
Gobo. Gobo gobo gobo.

02:30.880 --> 02:34.250
"They'll start to get restless 
if you force them, though."

02:34.460 --> 02:36.020
That's the problem.

02:36.020 --> 02:38.160
If we're going to capture 
their otaku hearts,

02:38.160 --> 02:39.890
we need to lead by example!

02:39.890 --> 02:43.200
Ooh, that pose gets my juices flowing!

02:43.200 --> 02:43.890
Whoa!

02:43.890 --> 02:46.340
Some tourists have arrived!

02:47.980 --> 02:51.980
I guess Akiba tours are 
a hit in the current day.

02:51.980 --> 02:52.990
Ladies and gentlemen,

02:52.990 --> 02:57.360
welcome to Old Akihabara, 
the Priority Otaku Protection Zone.

02:57.360 --> 02:58.870
Ooh!

02:58.870 --> 03:01.900
Is that a cringemobile convoy?
I've never seen a real one!

03:01.900 --> 03:02.860
Crazy!

03:11.660 --> 03:13.460
The otaku are coming out!

03:13.460 --> 03:15.640
Wow!

03:17.880 --> 03:20.260
Nobody said this was a tourist spot.

03:21.020 --> 03:24.000
We ain't a sideshow, damn it!

03:31.900 --> 03:35.080
Now that's a wild otaku! They've got a bite!

03:35.080 --> 03:37.520
But they sure look dorky.

03:37.520 --> 03:41.770
That's because they love wearing t-shirts 
with drawings of anime girls.

03:41.770 --> 03:46.580
The otaku might try to kidnap you, 
so stay far away from them, okay?

03:46.970 --> 03:52.640
You most likely won't see any violent, 
wild otaku outside of this area,

03:52.640 --> 03:58.920
but if you do happen to spot one, 
please contact the nearest SSC official.

04:02.180 --> 04:04.680
Serves you right! Get yer asses outta here!

04:04.680 --> 04:06.300
Peeping moron perverts!

04:06.300 --> 04:09.060
I wish you'd think about me sometimes.

04:12.490 --> 04:14.450
I'm getting hungry, too.

04:14.680 --> 04:17.600
Well, it's been a while 
since we've all gotten together,

04:17.600 --> 04:19.700
so why don't we hold a rally?

04:23.700 --> 04:24.740
Here you go.

04:25.200 --> 04:27.940
Very well, sir. Please.

04:28.950 --> 04:32.790
Welcome home, Master! Mistresses!

04:33.320 --> 04:34.040
Hiya.

04:34.420 --> 04:37.550
We haven't seen you in a while, 
Otaku Hero-sama.

04:37.550 --> 04:39.690
We're here, too, you know.

04:39.690 --> 04:41.030
But of course you are.

04:41.030 --> 04:43.240
Oh wow, you aren't into this at all!

04:43.240 --> 04:46.050
You're nice to Otaku Hero-sama 
but give us the cold shoulder?

04:46.310 --> 04:48.370
That isn't true at all.

04:48.670 --> 04:50.060
This way, please.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.820
So? What are we eating?

04:53.820 --> 04:54.940
Gobo gobo?

04:54.940 --> 04:57.670
Nah, they wouldn't have 
anything gooey like that here.

04:57.670 --> 04:58.170
Gobo...

04:58.170 --> 05:00.120
I'll go ahead and order.

05:01.060 --> 05:03.940
This and this and two of these.

05:01.070 --> 05:01.730
<b>Merry-Go-Round Go-Go♥Parfait</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:01.730
<b>Large Fried Oysters Riding the Big Ship</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:01.730
<b>French Fries with Gusto</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:01.730
<b>Onion Ring Potato Set</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:01.730
<b>Pretty Potato Set</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.740
<b>Thin-Roasted Crispy Potatoes</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.740
<b>Shakagori Potatoes</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.740
<b>Super Crispy Potatoes</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.740
<b>Whole Baked Potato</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:02.740
<b>Hot and Fluffy Buttered Potato</b>

05:02.780 --> 05:03.940
<b>Let's Go Early Star 4</b>

05:02.780 --> 05:04.030
<b>Snow White Snowden</b>

05:02.780 --> 05:04.110
<b>The Gentleman's Irish Cobbler</b>

05:02.780 --> 05:04.190
<b>The Queen's May Queen</b>

05:04.430 --> 05:06.080
