05:08.030 --> 05:10.570
This is heaven! Heaven, I say!

05:10.570 --> 05:13.880
We'll get bored waiting. Wanna play a game?

05:14.580 --> 05:17.330
The loser has to treat everyone.

05:18.600 --> 05:20.330
A quiz as old as time!

05:20.330 --> 05:22.090
Yay!

05:22.960 --> 05:27.130
There is no 'N' in the name 
of this marilyny-mansony rock star!

05:27.130 --> 05:29.060
Who is it, Otaku Hero-sama?

05:29.060 --> 05:29.960
Huh?

05:29.960 --> 05:31.970
Yes? And it is?

05:31.970 --> 05:33.680
You gotta be kidding!

05:34.320 --> 05:36.220
Marilyso Massososo?

05:36.220 --> 05:37.970
Aww.

05:37.970 --> 05:42.080
Unfortunately, Otaku Hero-sama now 
has to play a penalty game!

05:42.080 --> 05:43.640
Yay!

05:42.080 --> 05:43.640
Yippee!

05:43.640 --> 05:46.110
A textbook first move advantage.

05:46.110 --> 05:47.610
It was a trap!

05:49.860 --> 05:51.880
You were ready for bondage?!

05:52.620 --> 05:56.230
We're gonna grab and grope every 
inch of your body, Otaku Hero-sama.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.610
Try to hold back, okay?!

05:58.190 --> 06:01.420
Oh, I get it. This does look fun.

06:01.420 --> 06:03.170
Vroom...

06:03.520 --> 06:06.670
Y-Your body does have some... hard parts.

06:06.670 --> 06:08.540
Vroom...

06:08.540 --> 06:12.540
I can feel it! 
Your body heat, Otaku Hero-sama!

06:12.540 --> 06:14.060
Gobo...

06:14.060 --> 06:16.160
Gobo gobo!

06:17.460 --> 06:20.600
You sure this isn't a reward?

06:21.680 --> 06:23.560
Vroo—

06:24.810 --> 06:26.820
What do you think you're reaching for?

06:26.820 --> 06:27.440
His d**k.

06:27.440 --> 06:28.670
They won't let you say it!

06:28.670 --> 06:31.080
Gobo! Gobo gobo gobo!

06:31.080 --> 06:33.690
What?! His nipples are erect!

06:35.810 --> 06:39.380
Damn it! I can't let them 
have their way with me!

06:53.960 --> 06:57.160
The otaku crawl to the surface like vermin.

06:58.600 --> 07:01.100
How many of them are there?

07:01.350 --> 07:04.370
Then why don't you exterminate them?

07:04.370 --> 07:07.240
I've been hearing some bad rumors.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.600
Shobon-sama!

07:09.480 --> 07:12.060
Are the three magical girls together again?

07:12.490 --> 07:15.640
At this rate, the otaku will get 
the wrong message.

07:15.640 --> 07:18.870
