while they're still getting ready to act.

07:19.650 --> 07:21.740
SSC!

07:23.620 --> 07:25.210
How are Peloce's preparations coming?

07:25.630 --> 07:26.940
Already finished.

07:28.460 --> 07:30.720
<i>Now I can finally fulfill it.</i>

07:30.720 --> 07:33.720
<i>My destiny, my reason for living!</i>

07:34.480 --> 07:35.960
Ready for launch!

07:35.960 --> 07:36.980
Roger that!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.480
What's the best way
to handle otaku?

07:38.720 --> 07:40.480
Tolerance

07:38.720 --> 07:40.480
Extermination

07:40.480 --> 07:41.480
Who should be more
privileged in society?

07:40.480 --> 07:41.480
Otaku

07:40.480 --> 07:41.480
Normies

07:44.610 --> 07:49.360
<i>Otaku are such unsanitary, 
unbelievably selfish people.</i>

07:49.640 --> 07:51.390
<i>I learned that the hard way.</i>

07:51.860 --> 07:54.730
<i>They don't have any good parts; only bad.</i>

07:54.730 --> 07:57.090
<i>I have no greater enemy in this world.</i>

07:57.090 --> 07:59.880
Arms finished. Legs next!

08:02.380 --> 08:04.030
Start masking.

08:04.030 --> 08:06.250
Keep those decals right on the edges!

08:09.010 --> 08:10.960
<i>They can't appreciate the real thing.</i>

08:15.010 --> 08:18.510
<i>They live inside their 
feelings. A pathetic race.</i>

08:22.520 --> 08:24.020
<i>That's why I decided</i>

08:25.280 --> 08:27.530
<i>to eliminate the otaku with my own hands!</i>

08:29.660 --> 08:34.000
<i>I had to go through hell to get this far.</i>

08:40.500 --> 08:42.670
All systems ready for launch!

08:42.670 --> 08:44.710
Peloce, coming!

08:54.160 --> 08:55.640
