08:55.920 --> 08:58.000
Go get them!

09:00.310 --> 09:03.000
You just wait, Otaku Hero!

09:07.520 --> 09:09.240
Whoa!

09:09.240 --> 09:13.280
Since we're already here, 
shall we watch in secret?

09:16.260 --> 09:18.410
Incoming! Incoming!

09:20.650 --> 09:23.220
<i>Where are you, Otaku Hero?</i>

09:24.530 --> 09:25.960
<i>Filthy insects!</i>

09:32.520 --> 09:33.680
<i>Right there!</i>

09:37.470 --> 09:39.080
