09:40.200 --> 09:44.430
Otaku Hero, come out and fight me!

09:47.020 --> 09:48.130
Huh?

09:49.190 --> 09:52.280
Ah! H-Hey! No! Not right there!

09:54.190 --> 09:56.650
Huh? What's that?

09:56.650 --> 09:59.320
Seriously, stop! I can't hold it anymore!

09:59.970 --> 10:01.610
I surrender! I surrender!

10:01.220 --> 10:02.670
It's so big.

10:01.610 --> 10:04.670
Let's just say you won! Okay?

10:02.670 --> 10:04.670
This is the fifth floor.

10:04.670 --> 10:07.670
Go-bobo, gobo gobo-bobo.

10:05.980 --> 10:08.980
It certainly isn't 
a very pretty face, is it?

10:08.980 --> 10:10.920
A total derp face.

10:10.920 --> 10:12.300
You aren't kidding.

10:12.300 --> 10:16.680
Stop it!

10:14.120 --> 10:16.020
<i>Is that him?</i>

10:16.670 --> 10:20.680
<i>Is that really Otaku Hero? 
And the magical girls?</i>

10:21.310 --> 10:25.200
<i>I put myself through hell to fight </i>them<i>?</i>

10:25.640 --> 10:29.020
<i>Does my life count for anything?!</i>

10:32.640 --> 10:34.270
That engine sound!

10:37.740 --> 10:38.460
What?

10:38.460 --> 10:40.120
He must be one of the bad ones.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.860
The hell you think you doing?!

10:41.860 --> 10:44.820
I'm from SSC. 
One of the Four Heavenly Kings.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.480
Unit-@!

10:46.640 --> 10:48.460
Did he say SSC?

10:48.460 --> 10:49.600
Gobo gobo-bo.

10:49.600 --> 10:50.830
"And one of the Heavenly Kings?"

10:50.830 --> 10:53.420
And you came all this way to pick a fight?

10:53.420 --> 10:57.340
I was ordered to exterminate 
Otaku Hero and you magical girls.

10:57.340 --> 11:00.630
This Peloce and I are your opponents now.

11:00.630 --> 11:01.930
Fight me!

11:01.930 --> 11:03.360
You asked for it!

11:03.360 --> 11:06.480
Gobo gobo, gobo gobo-bo gobo.

11:05.190 --> 11:08.430
The first Heavenly King 
is always the weakest!

11:08.590 --> 11:09.860
Transform!

11:52.350 --> 11:53.350
<b>Transform</b>

12:01.240 --> 12:01.610
<b>Self-Righteousness</b>

12:02.030 --> 12:02.400
<b>Hope</b>

12:03.280 --> 12:03.660
<b>Love</b>

12:04.360 --> 12:04.870
<b>Transience</b>

12:09.290 --> 12:10.370
<b>Transformation Complete</b>

12:10.360 --> 12:12.630
Magical girls, on the scene!

12:12.630 --> 12:14.630
The rope is digging in!

12:14.630 --> 12:15.500
Let's go!

12:19.640 --> 12:22.130
Heaven's Flyswatter!

12:28.300 --> 12:29.180
Huh?

12:29.180 --> 12:30.140
Gobo?

12:29.180 --> 12:30.140
That fast?

12:31.140 --> 12:32.760
He comes so fast!

12:38.570 --> 12:40.520
This isn't Sunday.

12:40.520 --> 12:43.780
No pedestrian zone today. Lucky for me!

12:54.790 --> 12:57.640
It must be. It's him!

13:07.800 --> 13:09.800
Gobo-bo!

13:11.360 --> 13:13.060
Gobo-bo-bo-bo gobo-bo-bo bo-bo!

13:13.060 --> 13:16.820
Ow! But I think I kinda like it!

13:19.760 --> 13:23.560
These are the Revolutionary 
Army's trump cards?

13:23.560 --> 13:25.070
Gobo...

13:25.070 --> 13:26.300
Oh, no...

13:26.300 --> 13:27.570
It hurts so good!

13:27.570 --> 13:31.160
Quit treating this like a joke!

13:32.990 --> 13:34.590
Meep! Bwah!

13:34.590 --> 13:36.710
Blue-chan! Pink-chan!

13:36.710 --> 13:38.780
Go... Gobo bobo...

13:45.220 --> 13:49.470
Ow, ow, ow. That robotic junk pile!

13:52.130 --> 13:54.360
All right!

13:54.530 --> 13:56.030
Ow!

14:04.180 --> 14:06.610
Girls, you okay?

14:06.610 --> 14:08.480
That hurt.

14:08.710 --> 14:10.030
Gobo.

14:10.550 --> 14:12.870
Th-That was a little too rough!

14:13.190 --> 14:16.800
You can't face that huge, fast unit alone!

14:16.800 --> 14:18.990
The three of you have to combine forces!

14:18.990 --> 14:20.240
Gobo gobo?

14:20.240 --> 14:21.750
The three of us?

14:21.960 --> 14:23.260
Combine?

14:23.690 --> 14:25.190
You mean...

14:29.490 --> 14:31.270
I'll help, too!

14:31.520 --> 14:34.140
You mean a four-way?!

14:34.510 --> 14:36.280
Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!

14:36.280 --> 14:38.760
My body is ready!

14:38.760 --> 14:41.760
Hey! Don't go alone, you horny witch!

14:41.760 --> 14:43.130
Damn it!

14:44.400 --> 14:46.660
And I get left behind.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.960
Screw you!

15:05.960 --> 15:08.590
