15:18.790 --> 15:20.230
Say, Terumi-chan.

15:20.230 --> 15:21.680
It's Anarchy-chan!

15:21.680 --> 15:25.410
Otaku Hero-sama said we 
have to combine, right?

15:26.110 --> 15:28.000
