15:28.000 --> 15:29.870
Gobo gobo. Gobo!

15:29.870 --> 15:30.960
Right!

15:30.960 --> 15:35.120
If we let Otaku Hero-sama's 
imagination open our shells,

15:35.120 --> 15:37.480
