15:39.150 --> 15:39.870
Gobo.

15:39.870 --> 15:43.680
Whatever you're planning, 
you will never defeat me!

15:54.760 --> 15:55.500
It's you.

15:55.800 --> 15:58.920
I see you, following the traffic rules!

16:00.020 --> 16:01.360
The girls...

16:03.780 --> 16:06.780
Is he... Then maybe...!

16:06.780 --> 16:08.780
What the hell is his problem?

16:08.780 --> 16:11.700
Let's hurry! Let's hurry up and combine!

16:12.150 --> 16:13.410
Oh, no!

16:14.210 --> 16:16.580
Now, the final blow!

16:18.030 --> 16:18.840
Eww.

16:18.840 --> 16:19.780
Oh, gross.

16:25.920 --> 16:27.760
That's nasty.

16:27.760 --> 16:30.500
One hit from that would tear us to bits!

16:30.500 --> 16:31.670
Girls!

16:36.970 --> 16:38.640
You're split up now!

16:44.600 --> 16:47.860
Idiot! Asshole! SSC's a bunch of virgins!

16:48.780 --> 16:50.230
You won't get away!

16:53.040 --> 16:54.320
What's that?

16:54.320 --> 16:56.440
Damn it! Get out of my way!

16:58.750 --> 17:01.360
What's happening? I can't move. Why?

17:01.530 --> 17:03.660
Of course you can't.

17:03.660 --> 17:05.500
Not a car lover like you.

17:05.670 --> 17:06.920
Come on!

17:09.220 --> 17:10.500
What now?

17:11.840 --> 17:13.170
I can't move!

17:13.170 --> 17:14.800
Girls! Hit it now!

17:15.680 --> 17:18.440
Triple Destroy!

17:27.690 --> 17:29.940
Damn it! Move, move!

17:30.880 --> 17:31.940
Gobo gobo!

17:31.940 --> 17:34.320
Injection complete. Get him!

17:34.320 --> 17:36.000
Let's give it to him.

17:38.240 --> 17:42.240
How can they do this to me?!

17:59.590 --> 18:04.600
It isn't over. I haven't lost yet.

18:04.600 --> 18:07.090
No, you'll never win.

18:07.090 --> 18:09.610
How would you know?

18:09.610 --> 18:12.300
You used to be a car otaku, right?

18:12.880 --> 18:16.340
You were probably brainwashed 
or something by SSC.

18:16.650 --> 18:18.720
There's no way that happened.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.950
The fact that you didn't 
damage a single car,

18:20.950 --> 18:24.360
