18:28.080 --> 18:30.370
An otaku's heart still burns inside you.

18:30.730 --> 18:32.880
It will never go out!

18:34.250 --> 18:35.380
No.

18:36.400 --> 18:38.880
I don't even like cars.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.880
I'm not an otaku!

18:41.390 --> 18:44.390
And cars? Cars...

18:46.400 --> 18:47.680
They're so...

18:49.180 --> 18:54.400
I'm... I'm... a car otaku?

18:55.400 --> 18:56.440
Damn NPC!

18:59.590 --> 19:00.820
Huh?

18:59.590 --> 19:00.820
Wha—?

18:59.590 --> 19:00.820
Ha—?

18:59.590 --> 19:00.820
Bo—?

19:07.710 --> 19:09.320
Wh-What?!

19:37.610 --> 19:39.520
Who are you?

19:43.000 --> 19:44.230
Anarchy-chan?

19:45.370 --> 19:46.920
What the hell?

19:50.280 --> 19:51.710
Heaven's Aegis!

20:02.310 --> 20:04.150
Gobo, gobo...

20:04.150 --> 20:07.680
I'm not into pain without love.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.190
Let's do it!

20:14.190 --> 20:16.850
Triple Destroy!

20:22.070 --> 20:22.860
Huh?

20:22.860 --> 20:23.600
No way!

20:23.600 --> 20:24.700
Gobo!

20:37.330 --> 20:38.090
Girls!

20:41.560 --> 20:43.350
I guess that's that.

20:52.440 --> 20:54.440
Cringemobile driver guy!

20:58.570 --> 21:00.510
Cringemobile driver guy...

21:01.560 --> 21:04.080
What? You piece of shit!

21:04.080 --> 21:07.580
I really wanted to take 
Anarchy-chan for a drive,

21:07.580 --> 21:09.830
but I guess you'll have to do.

21:09.830 --> 21:12.320
Cool with you, partner?

21:16.370 --> 21:18.840
I'll slaughter you!

21:24.340 --> 21:28.180
Cringemobile driver guy!

21:29.800 --> 21:33.840
I didn't know SSC had people like that.

21:33.840 --> 21:35.720
Gobo gobo, gobo.

21:35.720 --> 21:37.100
Definitely.

21:37.110 --> 21:41.360
"They aren't fooling around." I guess not.

21:45.490 --> 21:52.500
What is this? What is this awful feeling?

23:25.710 --> 23:29.040
It turns. Time turns. Oh, how the age turns.

23:29.040 --> 23:31.740
Turning and turning into a swim meet.

23:31.740 --> 23:36.760
An otaku's secret love sinks 
and rises in the Kanda river.

23:37.000 --> 23:39.420
A legend revives.
